          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Video_Thumbnail.png",
            "title": "Understand what's going on with your pup.",
            "text": "<p>In this free call, we'll assess your challenges as well as your pup's breed and age to recommend actionable tips and schedule time with the ideal dog expert for your needs.</p>",
